  "body": "Several specs end up needing to define IDL that accepts a function which is called for its side effects, which means they use something like:\r\n\r\n```\r\ncallback VoidFunction = void ();\r\n```\r\n\r\nIt would be nice to have this defined in Infra so we didn't have to worry about colliding global names for this trivial concept.",
